{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓國女神金裕貞孭飛的新劇《百日謊言》正熱播，她更登上新一期「最具話題韓劇演員榜」第2位，緊次拍檔朴珍榮。而她昨日心情靚爆在韓國出席品牌活動，以全黑性感戰衣谷胸上陣，風騷大派心心，同場還有型男李洙赫與混血女模水原希子，同樣以全黑的型格打扮赴會。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T02:10:30.344544+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T01:27:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T15:13:32.653822+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T02:03:54.616216+00:00","content_hash":"9d096bf650146a6bb0534d551ef6158a9323874106fc5408748d6a6c7cf103b9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}